  "description": "Request/response RPC for SetNet. Call typed methods with await client.CallAsync<TReq,TResp>(...) and implement [RpcMethod] handlers server-side — added by composition (no RpcClient/RpcPeer base class), so it coexists with regular message handlers. Serializer-agnostic (uses your SetNetSerializer, no MessagePack dependency). Just reference the package.",
